step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> in <col=800000>Silvarea</col>, north-east of <col=800000>Varrock</col>, north of the <col=800000>Digsite</col>, during the conversation he will mention boiling the bones in vinegar..</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to the Odd Old Man in Silvarea, north-east of Varrock, north of the Digsite, during the conversation he will mention boiling the bones in vinegar..</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head to the sheep pen north of <col=800000>Ardougne</col>. <col=800000>Skills necklace</col> to the <col=800000>Fishing Guild</col> and run east or <col=800000>Combat bracelet</col> to the <col=800000>Ranging Guild</col> and run south, or <col=800000>Ardougne Teleport</col> and run north.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to the Odd Old Man in Silvarea, north-east of Varrock, north of the Digsite, during the conversation he will mention boiling the bones in vinegar..</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the sheep pen north of Ardougne. Skills necklace to the Fishing Guild and run east or Combat bracelet to the Ranging Guild and run south, or Ardougne Teleport and run north.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head to <col=800000>Musa Point</col>/the <col=800000>Karamja Volcano</col>. <col=800000>Amulet of glory</col> to <col=800000>Musa Point</col> or <col=800000>Minigame Teleport</col> to <col=800000>TzHaar Fight Pit</col>.</col>
