line	<str>Head to Draynor Village using the Amulet of glory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south past Varrock until you reach the south-east Varrock mine and kill a giant rat near or inside the mine, picking up the giant rat bone.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head slightly south of the mine to the forest and kill a unicorn and black bear, picking up the unicorn bone and the bear ribs respectively.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head into the sheep pen to the south-west of the mine and west of the forest and kill a ram to get a ram skull.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk south towards Lumbridge (or teleport to the city and walk east) and kill a goblin on the eastern side of the River Lum to get a goblin skull.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head down to the Lumbridge Swamp and kill one of the big frogs for the big frog leg. The small frogs and giant frogs do NOT drop the big frog leg.</str>
line	
line	<str>Retrieve 60 coins from the Draynor Village bank to pay for transportation in the next step. Consider retrieving an additional 8 coins and creating the required pots of vinegar before continuing (see the following section).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to Port Sarim. Talk to one of the Seamen just east of the Fishing shop and pay to travel to Musa Point.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk west towards the Karamja Volcano and kill a monkey on the way, picking up the monkey paw.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head into the Crandor and Karamja Dungeon, which is located at the top of the Karamja Volcano (marked by a dungeon icon), and kill a giant bat, picking up the giant bat wing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Fortunato located in Draynor marketplace and buy 8 jug of vinegar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use all of the jugs of vinegar with all the pots to make 8 pots of vinegar. If intending to do Rag and Bone Man II, buy 27 more (35 total) jugs of vinegar to save time.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use all of the bones with your pots of vinegar to get 8 bones in vinegar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one of the potted bones on a Fire. They will be cleaned one by one automatically.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col>.</col>
done	<str>Talk to the Odd Old Man in Silvarea, north-east of Varrock, north of the Digsite, during the conversation he will mention boiling the bones in vinegar..</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the sheep pen north of Ardougne. Skills necklace to the Fishing Guild and run east or Combat bracelet to the Ranging Guild and run south, or Ardougne Teleport and run north.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to Musa Point/the Karamja Volcano. Amulet of glory to Musa Point or Minigame Teleport to TzHaar Fight Pit.</str>
